    "content": "Chuck Norris (86, died March 20, 2026) was married to Gena O'Kelley (1998–2026) and previously to Dianne Holechek (1958–1989). He had five children—Mike, Eric, Dina, and twins Dakota and Danilee—along with 13 grandchildren, prioritizing family alongside his martial arts and acting career. Spouses Gena O'Kelley (m. 1998–2026): Met on the set of Walker, Texas Ranger and married in 1998. Dianne Holechek (m. 1958–1989): High school sweetheart, with whom he had two sons. Children Mike Norris (b. 1962): Son with Dianne. Eric Norris (b. 1965): Son with Dianne. Dina Norris (b. 1963): Daughter discovered later in life, born from a one-night stand. Dakota Alan Norris (b. 2001): Twin son with Gena. Danilee Kelly Norris (b. 2001): Twin daughter with Gena. Key Family Highlights Extended Family: He is survived by 13 grandchildren. Tragedy & Legacy: His first wife, Dianne, passed away in December 2025. Family Business: Sons Mike and Eric have worked in the entertainment industry as stunt performers, actors, and directors. Norris often credited his family as his biggest accomplishment, frequently appearing with them at public events and dedicating time to his kids.",
